troyed or created from this change\r\n\r\n* Bump chart version", "verified_at": "2024-01-16T19:59:59Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/PostHog/charts-clickhouse/commits/3c7e4a3aa3720fa93e86a7a7393f2e2360d91f97", "html_url": "https://github.com/PostHog/charts-clickhouse/commit/3c7e4a3aa3720fa93e86a7a7393f2e2360d91f97", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/PostHog/charts-clickhouse/commits/3c7e4a3aa3720fa93e86a7a7393f2e2360d91f97/comments", "author": {"login": "frankh", "id": 2088870, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIwODg4NzA=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2088870?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankh", "html_url": "https://github.com/frankh", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankh/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankh/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankh/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankh/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankh/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankh/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankh/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankh/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankh/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "committer": {"login": "web-flow", "id": 19864447, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow", "html_url": "https://github.com/web-flow", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "505cda4e6673620b394deda48c66d18ecf28d9ee", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/PostHog/charts-clickhouse/commits/505cda4e6673620b394deda48c66d18ecf28d9ee", "html_url": "https://github.com/PostHog/charts-clickhouse/commit/505cda4e6673620b394deda48c66d18ecf28d9ee"}]}, {"sha": "0ff28a6e326478586541533d816f0216eb7bdefc", "node_id": "C_kwDOFn2EoNoAKDBmZjI4YTZlMzI2NDc4NTg2NTQxNTMzZDgxNmYwMjE2ZWI3YmRlZmM", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Harry Waye", "email": "harry@posthog.com", "date": "2022-06-23T14:34:18Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2022-06-23T14:34:18Z"}, "message": "chore(hpa): update hpa apiVersion to autoscaling/v2beta2 (#447)\n\n* chore(hpa): update hpa apiVersion to autoscaling/v2beta2\r\n\r\nThis is to allow usage of the `behavior` attribute for controlling\r\nscaleUp and scaleDown. This will replace the existing autoscaling/v1\r\nmanifests. This is available in Kubernetes 1.21, our oldest supported\r\nversion.\r\n\r\n* chore: update to use autoscaling/v2beta2 spec\r\n\r\n* chore: also update pgbouncer hpa to autoscaling/v2beta2", "tree": {"sha": "f6fb2f764c22c96e718426228ffad1566c099aec", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/PostHog/charts-clickhouse/git/trees/f6fb2f764c22c96e718426228ffad1566c099aec"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/PostHog/charts-clickhouse/git/commits/0ff28a6e326478586541533d816f0216eb7bdefc", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJitHnqCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAqR0IAHVmqm2hljlY4W+3amVgGO+/\n9fYrMS8CfjnmXsZ3S8aIIdIOmgONdhonqbGVsAe++b8wFR1d9o/XbK8CYdHFcBQE\nKaJDRN6pfFDYI9D+qkXomG8Pe468c+XtRSM/7JqLbhc5wjekqyCtkXJQXa8nCXMK\nfxCsdBoW3yAdxcxrM9BLMHYw7GlNL5+QB3ZqGvPt3JJjdh8edrNNy/S6ZgJVGDXX\ncg9Vxmxk7ruHfEmOWLUdRfBlyODdWTqODGMRfv6+J3LLiZn8UbtCjSrrDDpNgNr7\nyPiFtSQ8YA7tzfF3Cdz3DyUNegQkenUnDmcIRfBrwleQ6p2zM21F7QkNPxiJ06I=\n=dvaq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree f6fb2f764c22c96e718426228ffad1566c099aec\nparent 5962e1236a3700ab72dbf026eccfc4631678dd2d\nauthor Harry Waye <harry@posthog.com> 1655994858 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1655994858 +0100\n\nchore(hpa): update hpa apiVersion to autoscaling/v2beta2 (#447)\n\n* chore(hpa): update hpa apiVersion to autoscaling/v2beta2\r\n\r\nThis is to allow usage of the `behavior` attribute for controlling\r\nscaleUp and scaleDown. This will replace the existing autoscaling/v1\r\nmanifests. This is available in Kubernetes 1.21, our oldest supported\r\nversion.\r\n\r\n* chore: update to use autoscaling/v2beta2 spec\r\n\r\n* chore: also update pgbouncer hpa to autoscaling/v2beta2", "verified_at": "2024-01-16T19:59:59Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/PostHog/charts-clickhouse/commits/0ff28a6e326478586541533d816f0216eb7bdefc", "html_url": "https://github.com/PostHog/charts-clickhouse/commit/0ff28a6e326478586541533d816f0216eb7bdefc", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/PostHog/charts-clickhouse/commits/0ff28a6e326478586541533d816f0216eb7bdefc/comments", "author": null, "committer": {"login": "web-flow", "id": 19864447, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow", "html_url": "https://github.com/web-flow", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "5962e1236a3700ab72dbf026eccfc4631678dd2d", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/PostHog/charts-clickhouse/commits/5962e1236a3700ab72dbf026eccfc4631678dd2d", "html_url": "https://github.com/PostHog/charts-clickhouse/commit/5962e1236a3700ab72dbf026eccfc4631678dd2d"}]}, {"sha": "35768dffed68db77938c488fa462edad2256ba40", "node_id": "C_kwDOFn2EoNoAKDM1NzY4ZGZmZWQ2OGRiNzc5MzhjNDg4ZmE0NjJlZGFkMjI1NmJhNDA", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Harry Waye", "email": "harry@posthog.com", "date": "2022-06-23T11:32:49Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2022-06-23T11:32:49Z"}, "message": "feat(hpa): add ability to set behavior on HPA manifests (#444)\n\n* feat(hpa): add non-abstracted hpa config values\r\n\r\nPreviously we had a thin abstraction over a subset of the hpa config.\r\nRather than maintain this abstraction I have simply exposed the\r\nunderlying spec for hpa manifests. This was we can use the full range of\r\nhpa without needing to make chart interface changes.\r\n\r\nI've added this as the existing configuration can exhibit a lot of\r\nflapping, where we might go from 10 pods, down to 5, only to then\r\nrequest another 5 pods directly after. I would like to set the\r\n`behavior.scaleDown.stabilizationWindowSeconds` setting to a higher\r\nvalue than the default.\r\n\r\nNote that this does not include the pluginsAsync values addition at the\r\nmoment. This is because we do not have an HPA manifest for pluginsAsync,\r\nI'll handle this separately.\r\n\r\nThe reason for not reusing e.g. `web.hpa` is to avoid any unexpected\r\nbehaviour with existing values people may have. I chose `autoscaling`\r\nbsaed on a similarly structured value in the `ingress-nginx` helm chart.\r\n\r\n* chore: change to reuse hpa\r\n\r\nRather than creating a new value, I've decided that, given all I want to\r\ndo is set the behavior I'll just focus on this. I do not apply any\r\nexpected schema to this, rather it directly sets the behavior on the\r\nspec to avoid needing to maintain an abstraction.", "tree": {"sha": "1729fe9e2cb7e4752d5155cc5e3a7d9bc35ae424", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/PostHog/charts-clickhouse/git/trees/1729fe9e2cb7e4752d5155cc5e3a7d9bc35ae424"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/PostHog/charts-clickhouse/git/commits/35768dffed68db77938c488fa462edad2256ba40", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJitE9hCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAj68IAAmLGcnHapCZ8uHS8BTceisq\nLU4FwJEKEEnGNilSh9mcxEnPfAzGEYPng3vcDOoL1d/s34GA+6jcc+X/arvtQ4Bm\nbpKZUPNlHX8Mz8O0uMLSUYBYr/B4LSI2crvwc7BO0uhaA7YFpJmm1BmUY4dOVynE\nN58SmU4lSp0TFb+nvpG0DjL02Y4JYRJpZ7508vBwxXiKwz+9aYOQBDrZD2/snCee\ngVmenQseAuv8yup9Onw7wi1fj1FBQMuRi4/L+MtFG+cs5CRi2C4m2IU9HV4PYBkd\njY1X8gDknd0JF+RUZbpcgT+btEQX/cKqEelDSEIMTjaxLnt/rdf65mm/hOcPK4M=\n=5AkZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree 1729fe9e2cb7e4752d5155cc5e3a7d9bc35ae424\nparent 4abb98d2ecda897312e730a962b2bc2378721024\nauthor Harry Waye <harry@posthog.com> 1655983969 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1655983969 +0100\n\nfeat(hpa): add ability to set behavior on HPA manifests (#444)\n\n* feat(hpa): add non-abstracted hpa config values\r\n\r\nPreviously we had a thin abstraction over a subset of the hpa config.\r\nRather than maintain this abstraction I have simply exposed the\r\nunderlying spec for hpa manifests. This was we can use the full range of\r\nhpa without needing to make chart interface changes.\r\n\r\nI've added this as the existing configuration can exhibit a lot of\r\nflapping, where we might go from 10 pods, down to 5, only to then\r\nrequest another 5 pods directly after. I would like to set the\r\n`behavior.scaleDown.stabilizationWindowSeconds` setting to a higher\r\nvalue than the default.\r\n\r\nNote that this does not include the pluginsAsync values addition at the\r\nmoment. This is because we do not have an HPA manifest for pluginsAsync,\r\nI'll handle this separately.\r\n\r\nThe reason for not reusing e.g. `web.hpa` is to avoid any unexpected\r\nbehaviour with existing values people may have. I chose `autoscaling`\r\nbsaed on a similarly structured value in the `ingress-nginx` helm chart.\r\n\r\n* chore: change to reuse hpa\r\n\r\nRather than creating a new value, I've decided that, given all I want to\r\ndo is set the behavior I'll just focus on this. I do not apply any\r\nexpected schema to this, rather it directly sets the behavior on the\r\nspec to avoid needing to maintain an abstraction.", "verified_at": "2024-01-16T19:59:59Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/PostHog/charts-clickhouse/commits/35768dffed68db77938c488fa462edad2256ba40", "html_url": "https://github.com/PostHog/charts-clickhouse/commit/35768dffed68db77938c488fa462edad2256ba40", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/PostHog/charts-clickhouse/commits/35768dffed68db77938c488fa462edad2256ba40/comments", "author": null, "committer": {"login": "web-flow", "id": 19864447, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow", "html_url": "https://github.com/web-flow", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo